` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. This was a one-line change made on a new branch, `fix/money-bankers-rounding`.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that branch.\n- **PR:** I opened #101 against main without requesting any reviewers. It was merged after code-owner approval (\"Approved. Looks right.\").\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory system didn't recognize that ID. The fix is based on the test and the code comment, which both say banker's rounding.", "type": "text"}]}]}